+
+title: Qualcomm MSM8660 Multimedia Subsystem System Fabric Peripheral Bus
+
+maintainers:
+  - BlackF1re <plevickij57@gmail.com>
+
+description:
+  The MMSS SFPB exposes multimedia subsystem fabric configuration registers
